Verification of Variable Stream PRB Information within PRB Pooling Report
    ${file_path_report} =      set variable    ${sherpa_output_path}/tcpdump/Dl_PrbPoolingAllocationSubpool_45_.csv
    @{NumAllocStreamPrbColumn}                      Get all values NumAllocStreamPrb column       file=${file_path_report}
    ...                                             ColumnName=NumAllocStreamPrb
    ${PrbAlloc_LenList}=  Get Length    ${NumAllocStreamPrbColumn}
    ${endOfSum}=        Evaluate      ${PrbAlloc_LenList} - 1
#    Dated Log    length ofNumAllocStreamPrbColumn List is    ${PrbAlloc_LenList}
#    Log    ${PrbAlloc_LenList}
    FOR      ${i}   IN           @{NumAllocStreamPrbColumn}
#            Log    @{NumAllocStreamPrbColumn}[${index_SP0}]
#            Log    @{NumAllocStreamPrbColumn}[${index_SP1}]
            ${sum}        Evaluate     @{NumAllocStreamPrbColumn}[${index_SP0}] + @{NumAllocStreamPrbColumn}[${index_SP1}]
            Should Be Equal    ${sum}    ${2400}
            ${index_SP0}=                             Evaluate     ${index_SP0} + 2
            ${index_SP1}=                             Evaluate     ${index_SP1} + 2
            Exit For Loop If    ${index_SP0}>=${endOfSum}

    END



Get all values NumAllocStreamPrb column
    [Documentation]         Get all the values of a column of a csv file.
    [Arguments]             ${file}    ${ColumnName}
    tafSherpaCsvReader.setup_reader    ${file}
    tafSherpaCsvReader.print all
    @{NumAllocStreanPrbColumn}              tafSherpaCsvReader.Get Values For Column       column=${ColumnName}
    [Return]                        ${NumAllocStreanPrbColumn}


Suite Setup CB008940-G
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     customs configurations yamlPathname
    ...     Actions:        it performs the generic suite setup and backup the configurations files
    ...     Checks:         it checks nothing more than already done on lib.
    ...     Verdict:        suite setup is passed

        [Arguments]             ${yamlPathname}=${EMPTY}

    Setup.Suite Setup from scratch        yamlPathname=${yamlPathname}
    ...                                   listBackupFiles=${FD_ALL}
    ...                                   keepAllUeDataInCfgFile=${True}

    Backup Files
    ${scf_suite_setup_backup}         OAM Get SCF File    file=SCF_Suite_Setup_Backup.xml
    Set Suite Variable      ${scf_suite_setup_backup}
    Dated Log               SCF backup file = ${scf_suite_setup_backup}

Set RAD Params Of 8940-G
   [Documentation]     Add or Modify the RAD params of 8940 To Activate the feature
    ...                 will be replaced later by NIDD params
    ...                 0x580117=1 : #CSI-RS Event Sherpa
    ...                 0x590191=0 # rdSlowPrbPoolingTddFr1UseHardcodedTrackingCsiRs, 0=hardcoded, 1=dynamic
    ...                 0x420068=3 : rdFeatureFlagBitmap1 :
    ...                 bit 2 -> CB007113 : 0  (disabled)

    ...                 bit 1 -> CB008847 : 1 (enabled)
    ...                 bit 0 -> CB008940 : 1 (enabled)
    ...                 0x58066a=1 : InterL1SubPool         - 0 : Disabled - 1 : Enabled

    Dated Log New Line   Add RAD params of 8940-G InterL1SubPool ......
    ${rad_param_1}=      create dictionary       field=0x580117    value=1
    ${rad_param_2}=      create dictionary       field=0x420068    value=3
    ${rad_param_3}=      create dictionary       field=0x590191    value=0
    ${rad_param_4}=      create dictionary       field=0x58066a    value=1
    ${rad_param_list}=       Create List         ${rad_param_1}
    ...                                          ${rad_param_2}
    ...                                          ${rad_param_3}
    ...                                          ${rad_param_4}
    Dated Log New Line    RAD params :  ${rad_param_list}
    SetConfig.Set Fields in swconfig DU       param_list=${rad_param_list}
    Dated Log New Line   RAD params of 8940-G update completed

Check PRB Allocation
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the argument ${nrCell_id} ${prb_req} ${prb_value} ${result_req} ${check_operator}
    ...     Actions:        it verifies the PRB Alloc for NRCell
    ...     Checks:         it checks the PRB value for NRCell within PRB Pooling Allocation SubPool Report
    ...     Verdict:        PRB Allocated is as expected
    [Arguments]             ${nrCell_id}
    ...                     ${prb_req}
    ...                     ${prb_value}
    ...                     ${result_req}=True
    ...                     ${check_operator}===

    ${file_path_report}     Set Variable        Dl_PrbPoolingAllocationReport_45_.csv
    # prb_value
    Dated Log New Line      Check if ${prb_value}${check_operator}${prb_req} for ${COL_NAME_NRCELLID}=${nrCell_id}
    Dated Log               ${file_path_report}
    ${verif_result}         Verify value with operator in csv Files with Prerequisite
    ...                                         CsvName=${file_path_report}
    ...                                         ColumnName=${prb_req}
    ...                                         valuetocheck=${prb_value}
    ...                                         check_operator=${check_operator}
    ...                                         directory=${sherpa_output_path}
    ...                                         colum_prereq=${COL_NAME_NRCELLID}
    ...                                         regex_prereq=${nrCell_id}
    Run Keyword If          ${verif_result} == True
    ...                     Dated Log    DL PRB Allocated is passed for NRCell
    ...         ELSE        Dated Log    DL PRB Allocated IS NOT PASSED for NRCell
    should be true          ${verif_result} == ${result_req}


Check Min and MAX PRB values
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the arguments ${num_min_prb} ${num_max_prb} ${prereq_data} ${prereq_value} ${result_req}
    ...                     ${check_operator}
    ...     Actions:        it verifies all the numMinPrbAlloc and numMaxPrbAlloc values of the recommended data
    ...     Checks:         it checks the values within PRB Pooling Allocation SubPool Report
    ...     Verdict:        numMinPrbAlloc, numMaxPrbAlloc values are as expected
    [Arguments]             ${num_min_prb}=${NUM_MIN_PRB_DEFAULT}
    ...                     ${num_max_prb}=${NUM_MAX_PRB_DEFAULT}
    ...                     ${prereq_data}=${COL_NAME_SUBPOOLID}
#   ...                     ${prereq_data}=${COL_NAME_NRCELLID}
    ...                     ${prereq_value}=0
#   ...                     ${prereq_value}=${prereq_value}
    ...                     ${result_req}=True
    ...                     ${check_operator}===

    ${file_path_report}     Set Variable        Dl_PrbPoolingAllocationReport_45_.csv
    # numMinPrbAlloc
    @{listOfValues}         Create List         ${num_min_prb}
    Dated Log New Line      Check if ${COL_NAME_NUMMINPRBALLOC}=${listOfValues} for ${prereq_data}=${prereq_value}
    Dated Log               ${file_path_report}
    ${verif_result}         Verify Value List In csv File Column
    ...                                         CsvName=${file_path_report}
    ...                                         Column_name=${COL_NAME_NUMMINPRBALLOC}
    ...                                         value_list=${listOfValues}
    ...                                         prereq_column=${prereq_data}
    ...                                         prereq_column_val=${prereq_value}
    Run Keyword If          ${verif_result} == True
    ...                     Dated Log    DL Num Min PRB Alloc is equal to ${num_min_prb} for ${prereq_data}=${prereq_value}
    ...         ELSE        Dated Log    DL Num Min PRB Alloc IS NOT EQUAL TO ${num_min_prb} for ${prereq_data}=${prereq_value}
    should be true          ${verif_result} == True
    # numMaxPrbAlloc
    @{listOfValues}         Create List         ${num_max_prb}
    Dated Log New Line      Check if ${COL_NAME_NUMMAXPRBALLOC}=${listOfValues} for ${prereq_data}=${prereq_value}
    Dated Log               ${file_path_report}
    ${verif_result}         Verify Value List In csv File Column
    ...                                         CsvName=${file_path_report}
    ...                                         Column_name=${COL_NAME_NUMMAXPRBALLOC}
    ...                                         value_list=${listOfValues}
    ...                                         prereq_column=${prereq_data}
    ...                                         prereq_column_val=${prereq_value}
    Run Keyword If          ${verif_result} == True
    ...                     Dated Log    DL Num Max PRB Alloc is equal to ${num_max_prb} for ${prereq_data}=${prereq_value}
    ...         ELSE        Dated Log    DL Num Max PRB Alloc IS NOT EQUAL TO ${num_max_prb} for ${prereq_data}=${prereq_value}
    should be true          ${verif_result} == True

Cell Lock
       [Documentation]
    ...     Lock Cell 3 in order to have Free PRB in L1 subpool0
    Oam.OAM Cell Lock  cell_id=3
    Dated Log   Current status of cell 3 is blocked

Cell Unlock
    Oam.OAM Cell Lock  state=UNLOCK     cell_id=3
    Dated Log   Current status of cell 3 is unblocked

SA Call DL Traffic With UE Profile
    [Arguments]                      ${ue_profile}
    [Documentation]                  1  UE SA call  based on UE profile (ue_id, pdu, gw, dl_tput, ul_tput, deviation)
    ...                              This keyword can be used to perform a UE call based on the UE profile
    ...                              how to use :
    ...                              - create a dictionary of ue profile with the following structure:
    ...                                 &{Profile_UE}
    ...                                     ue_id=1
    ...                                     pdu=1
    ...                                     gw=1
    ...                                     dl_tput=175   #(tput in mbps)
    ...                                     deviation=40  #(percentage of expected deviation of tput)
    ...                              - call the keyword with the UE profile
    ...                                     SA Call DL Traffic With UE Profile     ${Profile_UE}
    CallSetup.UE Register            ue=${ue_profile.ue_id}
    sleep                            1s
    CallSetup.Launch PDU Session     ue=${ue_profile.ue_id}     pdu=${ue_profile.pdu}       gw=${ue_profile.gw}
    sleep                            1s
    ${ueSetting}                     set variable            ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    ${ueSetting.pdu}                 set variable            ${ue_profile.ue_id}
    ${ueSetting.ue}                  set variable            ${ue_profile.ue_id}
    Traffic UE DL                    ueSetting=${BASIC_UE_SA}    throughput=${ue_profile.dl_tput}
    ...                              shouldBeStop=False          deviation=${ue_profile.deviation}
    ...                              shouldBeCheck=False

DL Traffic With UE Profile
    [Arguments]                      ${ue_profile}
    [Documentation]                  1  UE DL Traffic  based on UE profile (ue_id, pdu, gw, dl_tput, ul_tput, deviation)
    ...                              This keyword can be used to perform ONLY DL Traffic based on the UE profile
    ...                              how to use :
    ...                              - create a dictionary of ue profile with the following structure:
    ...                                 &{Profile_UE}
    ...                                     ue_id=1
    ...                                     pdu=1
    ...                                     gw=1
    ...                                     dl_tput=175   #(tput in mbps)
    ...                                     deviation=40  #(percentage of expected deviation of tput)
    ...                              - call the keyword with the UE profile
    ...                                     DL Traffic With UE Profile     ${Profile_UE}
    ${ueSetting}                     set variable            ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    ${ueSetting.pdu}                 set variable            ${ue_profile.ue_id}
    ${ueSetting.ue}                  set variable            ${ue_profile.ue_id}
    Traffic UE DL                    ueSetting=${BASIC_UE_SA}    throughput=${ue_profile.dl_tput}
    ...                              shouldBeStop=False          deviation=${ue_profile.deviation}
    ...                              shouldBeCheck=False


Multi Cells Setup 8940
    [Arguments]       ${nbCell}
    ${msgStr}=    Catenate  Test ${nbCell} Cells Setup
    Dated Log   ${msgStr}
    Setup Wtsemu SA
    sleep    60s
    WTS Set X2 Link
    sleep    5s
   # WTS Testmode Decode PDSCH On SSB Slot

WTS Testmode Decode PDSCH On SSB Slot
    wtsemu.ue_testmode_decode_muxphychan    decode_mux_phy_chan=decode_PDSCH
    sleep    2s

Recommissioning
    Oam.OAM Perform Full Commissioning       scf_file=${SCF_SETUP_PATH}
    WA Airscale Wait For Ready               ${GNB_DU}

End Of TC Teardown
   [Documentation]        At the end of each TC :
   ...                      - show the Diagnosis of the TC steps
   ...                      - collect the gnb Snapshot
   ...                      - if TC failed, collect also AP sosReport

   Dated Log              End Of TC : start
   Oam.OAM Get Snapshot
   # Run Keyword If Test Failed     Setup.Get Sos Report
   GenericTest.Display Diagnosis
   Dated Log              End of TC : end


